# Fly OS intentionally does not ship an invasive KWin binary patch in 0.1.
#
# KWin 6.6 already implements dual-Kawase blur and exposes BlurStrength.
# The Fly OS default sets BlurStrength=10 and NoiseStrength=2 through kwinrc.
#
# When a source-level visual effect becomes necessary, create it against:
#   Ubuntu source package: kwin 6.6.x
#   upstream path: src/plugins/blur/
#
# Keep the patch buildable against the exact KWin version in the target Ubuntu
# point release. KWin effects are ABI-sensitive.
